"""Central work-coordination CLI.

The registry is the authority for task identity, dependency edges, claims and
revisions. Boards remain the authority for local packet execution state. Every
mutation is compare-and-swap on `revision`, takes a lease, and appends an
entry to the hash-chained `events.ndjson` audit log.

Run `./task --help` or see PROTOCOL.md.
"""
